    "Scan of the 1957 edition of the Cumberland Center, Maine, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers. Surveyed in 1941; aerial photographs from 1970; field checked in 1944; photo inspected in 1975; photo revised in 1970; printed in 1989.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.5 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
